msgstr "使用 `w3fdif` 過濾器對輸入視訊去交錯"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:146
msgid "Set the interlacing filter coefficients."
msgstr "設定交錯過濾器係數。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:148 videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:158
