msgstr "指定要進行去交錯的畫格。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:150
msgid "Deinterlace the input video with `yadif` filter. Using FFmpeg, this is the best and fastest choice"
msgstr "使用 `yadif` 過濾器對輸入視訊去交錯。在使用 FFmpeg 時，這是最佳且最快的選擇"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:153
msgid ""
"mode\n"
"The interlacing mode to adopt."
msgstr ""
"模式\n"
"要採用的交錯模式。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:155
msgid ""
"parity\n"
"The picture field parity assumed for the input interlaced video."
msgstr ""
"同位\n"
"輸入交錯視訊所假設的圖片場同位。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:160
msgid "Simple interlacing filter from progressive contents."
msgstr "來自漸進式內容的簡易交錯過濾器。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:162
msgid ""
"scan:\n"
"determines whether the interlaced frame is taken from the even (tff - default) or odd (bff) lines of the progressive frame."
msgstr ""
"掃描：\n"
"決定交錯畫格是取自漸進式畫格的偶數 (tff - 預設) 還是奇數 (bff) 行。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_deinterlace.py:166
msgid ""
"lowpass:\n"
"Enable (default) or disable the vertical lowpass filter to avoid twitter interlacing and reduce moire patterns.\n"
"Default is no setting."
msgstr ""
"低通：\n"
"啟用 (預設) 或停用垂直低通過濾器，以避免閃爍交錯並減少摩爾紋。\n"
"預設為無設定。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:56
msgid "Denoiser Filters"
msgstr "降噪過濾器"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:60
msgid "Enable nlmeans denoiser"
msgstr "啟用 nlmeans 降噪器"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:73
msgid "nlmeans options"
msgstr "nlmeans 選項"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:82
msgid "Enable hqdn3d denoiser"
msgstr "啟用 hqdn3d 降噪器"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:91
msgid "hqdn3d options"
msgstr "hqdn3d 選項"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:116
msgid "Denoiser Tool"
msgstr "降噪工具"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:117
msgid ""
"nlmeans:\n"
"Denoise frames using Non-Local Means algorithm is capable of restoring video sequences, even with strong noise. It is ideal for enhancing the quality of old VHS tapes."
msgstr ""
"nlmeans:\n"
"使用非局部均值 (Non-Local Means) 演算法對畫格進行降噪，即使有強烈雜訊也能還原視訊序列。這非常適合用於增強舊 VHS 錄影帶的品質。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_denoisers.py:122
msgid ""
"hqdn3d:\n"
"This is a high precision/quality 3d denoise filter. It aims to reduce image noise, producing smooth images and making still images really still. It should enhance compressibility."
msgstr ""
"hqdn3d:\n"
"這是高精確度/高品質的 3D 降噪過濾器。其目標是減少影像雜訊，產生平滑的影像，並讓靜止影像更加穩定。這應能增強壓縮率。"

