msgstr "分母"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_scale.py:167
msgid "Setsar filter (sample aspect ratio) example 1/1"
msgstr "Setsar 過濾器 (取樣長寬比) 範例 1/1"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_scale.py:218
msgid "Resize Tool"
msgstr "調整大小工具"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_scale.py:219
msgid "Scale filter, set to 0 to disable"
msgstr "縮放過濾器，設為 0 以停用"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_scale.py:222
msgid "Display Aspect Ratio. Set to 0 to disable"
msgstr "顯示長寬比。設為 0 以停用"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_scale.py:225
msgid ""
"Sample (aka Pixel) Aspect Ratio.\n"
"Set to 0 to disable"
msgstr ""
"取樣 (即像素) 長寬比。\n"
"設為 0 以停用"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_scale.py:369
msgid ""
"If you want to keep the aspect ratio, select \"Constrain proportions\" below and\n"
"specify only one dimension, either width or height, and set the other dimension\n"
"to -1 or -2 (some codecs require -2, so you should do some testing first)."
msgstr ""
"如果您想保持長寬比，請選取下方的「限制比例」，並\n"
"僅指定寬度或高度其中一個維度，然後將另一個維度設定\n"
"為 -1 或 -2 (某些編解碼器需要 -2，因此您應先進行測試)。"

#: videomass/vdms_dialogs/filter_stab.py:82
