msgstr "目標等級："

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:257
msgid "Gets maximum volume and average volume data in dBFS, then calculates the offset amount for audio normalization."
msgstr "取得 dBFS 中的最大音量與平均音量資料，然後計算音訊正規化的偏移量。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:260
msgid "Limiter for the maximum peak level or the mean level (when switch to RMS) in dBFS. From -99.0 to +0.0; default for PEAK level is -1.0; default for RMS is -20.0"
msgstr "dBFS 中最大峰值等級或平均等級 (切換至 RMS 時) 的限制器。從 -99.0 到 +0.0；PEAK 等級預設為 -1.0；RMS 預設為 -20.0"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:264
msgid ""
"\"Auto\", lets FFmpeg select the audio stream to process (usually the first audio stream). If the source file(s) is just an audio track, it's recommend to always set this control to \"Auto\".\n"
"\n"
"\"1-16\", if a video file contains more than one audio stream, you can select a specific one, e.g \"1\" for the first available audio stream, \"2\" for the second audio stream, and so on."
msgstr ""
"「自動」，讓 FFmpeg 選取要處理的音訊串流 (通常是第一個音訊串流)。如果來源檔案只是音軌，建議總是將此控制項設為「自動」。\n"
"\n"
"「1-16」，如果視訊檔案包含多個音訊串流，您可以選取特定的一個，例如 \"1\" 代表第一個可用的音訊串流，\"2\" 代表第二個音訊串流，依此類推。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:272
msgid ""
"\"Auto\" keeps all audio streams and processes only the one selected by the \"Index Selection\" control.\n"
"\n"
"\"All\" processes all audio streams with the properties of the one selected by the \"Index Selection\" control. Don't use \"All\" to export audio files from videos.\n"
"\n"
"\"Index Only\" processes only the audio stream selected by the \"Index Selection\" control and removes all others from the output video."
msgstr ""
"「自動」保留所有音訊串流，並僅處理「索引選取」控制項所選取的那一個。\n"
"\n"
"「全部」處理所有音訊串流，並套用「索引選取」控制項所選取者的屬性。請勿使用「全部」從視訊匯出音訊檔案。\n"
"\n"
"「僅索引」僅處理「索引選取」控制項所選取的音訊串流，並從輸出視訊中移除所有其他串流。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:281
msgid "Integrated Loudness Target in LUFS. From -70.0 to -5.0, default is -16.0"
msgstr "LUFS 中的整合響度目標。從 -70.0 到 -5.0，預設為 -16.0"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:284
msgid "Maximum True Peak in dBTP. From -1.5 to +0.0, default is -2.0"
msgstr "dBTP 中的最大真實峰值。從 -1.5 到 +0.0，預設為 -2.0"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:287
msgid "Loudness Range Target in LUFS. From +1.0 to +20.0, default is +11.0"
msgstr "LUFS 中的響度範圍目標。從 +1.0 到 +20.0，預設為 +11.0"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:290
msgid "Play the audio stream selected in the \"Index Selection\" control. Using this function you can test the result of audio normalization."
msgstr "播放「索引選取」控制項中選取的音訊串流。使用此功能可測試音訊正規化的結果。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:512
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Index does not exist in the selected source file:\n"
"\"{}\""
msgstr ""
"選取的來源檔案中不存在索引：\n"
"\"{}\""

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:519
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The source file does not contain any audio stream:\n"
"\"{}\""
msgstr ""
"來源檔案不包含任何音訊串流：\n"
"\"{}\""

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:735
msgid "PEAK level normalization, which will produce a maximum peak level equal to the set target level."
msgstr "PEAK 等級正規化，將產生等於設定目標等級的最大峰值等級。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:738
msgid "RMS-based normalization, which according to mean volume calculates the amount of gain to reach same average power signal."
msgstr "基於 RMS 的正規化，依據平均音量計算增益量，以達到相同的平均功率訊號。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:742
msgid ""
"Loudnorm normalization. Normalizes the perceived loudness using the \"loudnorm\" filter, which implements the EBU R128 algorithm.\n"
"Ideal for live normalization. It produces worse results than the High-quality two-pass Loudnorm normalization, but is faster."
msgstr ""
"Loudnorm 正規化。使用 \"loudnorm\" 過濾器將感知響度正規化，實作 EBU R128 演算法。\n"
"非常適合即時正規化。其結果比高品質二次行程 Loudnorm 正規化差，但速度較快。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:749
msgid ""
"High-quality two-pass Loudnorm normalization. Normalizes the perceived loudness using the \"loudnorm\" filter, which implements\n"
"the EBU R128 algorithm. Ideal for postprocessing."
msgstr ""
"高品質二次行程 Loudnorm 正規化。使用 \"loudnorm\" 過濾器將感知響度正規化，實作\n"
"EBU R128 演算法。非常適合後製處理。"

#: videomass/vdms_panels/audio_encoders/acodecs.py:798
msgid "You need to import at least one file"
msgstr "您至少需要匯入一個檔案"

